{"assets":["/statement-assets/46c6eb603e2ae7abcb01f5b631c45bcf3089c87ec734db09e1efa23bc95d2f00.png"],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"126","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Hot Bath"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Bob is about to take a hot bath. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are two taps to fill the bath: a hot water tap and a cold water tap. The cold water's temperature is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t1"},{"kind":"text","text":", and the hot water's temperature is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"t2"},{"kind":"text","text":". The cold water tap can transmit any integer number of water units per second from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x1"},{"kind":"text","text":", inclusive. Similarly, the hot water tap can transmit from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"0"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"x2"},{"kind":"text","text":" water units per second."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"If "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y1"},{"kind":"text","text":" water units per second flow through the first tap and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"y2"},{"kind":"text","text":" water units per second flow through the second tap, then the resulting bath water temperature will be:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"alt":"","src":"/statement-assets/46c6eb603e2ae7abcb